{"OptimizedImage.downsize is defined twice, and the later 3-arg+opts definition overwrites the original width/height signature, so existing callers passing (from,to,width,height,opts) will raise ArgumentError. This breaks Jobs::ResizeEmoji at runtime and prevents emoji resizing from running.": 0.9286167025566101, "For API URL uploads, the server now downloads up to a fixed 10MB regardless of configured max image/attachment sizes, wasting bandwidth/CPU for attachments that will be rejected and preventing downsizing for images >10MB because they never download. This changes behavior from being setting-driven to hardcoded and can be abused to force repeated 10MB downloads.": 0.9550774693489075}